( https://albiononline.com/news/new-bundles )

Adventurer,

Want to upgrade your appearance and score some extra Gold on the side? Then=
 check out the new *Vanity Value Bundles* in the in-game store! These bundl=
es offer vanity items in combination with *Gold,* and are available to *all=
 players across all platforms.*

These bundles consist of a popular *mount skin* or *vanity set* along with =
varying amounts of Gold, and offer big discounts compared with buying separ=
ately. The current bundles include:

* *Mage Adventurer Vanity Bundle*
* *Knight Adventurer Vanity Bundle*
* *Rogue Adventurer Vanity Bundle*
* *Mistbison Vanity Bundle*
* *Miststalker Vanity Bundle*

Log into the game now to purchase these from the store!

( https://albiononline.com/news/master-of-fists )

Become a Master Fighter
-----------------------

A brand-new vanity bundle has arrived - the powerful *Master of Fists* ! Av=
ailable now from the in-game store, this premium bundle includes a full cos=
tume set along with a matching *Master of Fists Horse skin* for your Riding=
 Horse base mount.

The mask and robes also include optional *guild versions* to show off your =
guild's colors, and a variety of headpieces that you can change as you plea=
se. With the stylings of a close-combat expert, this is the perfect set to =
use in combination with the *War Gloves* weapon line, so grab this premiere=
 bundle now and demonstrate your fighting skills!

( https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=3DYNLrtIlM-dE )

Dev Talk: Roadmap 2022
----------------------

In case you missed it, our most recent *Dev Talk* introduces some of the ex=
citing developments coming to Albion Online this year. Watch the video here=
 for a taste of what=E2=80=99s to come:

LEARN MORE ( https://albiononline.com/news/devtalk-2022-roadmap )

